[[File:Map042.png|center|350px]]
'''Stratospheric Pathway''' (異空行路の先に, ''Ikū Kōro no Saki Ni'', '''Up Ahead on the Alternate Dimension's Path''') is the 10th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 108th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Like most of the previous Zero Legends sub-chapters, the stages here aren't too much of a threat. In particular, [[Steps Great and Small]] is trivialized by [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]], while [[Prairie Harbor]] mainly serves to showcase [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Catcrates]].
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 2 new enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[Dogenstein]]: A [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Doge]] that has even higher health than a 200% [[Wild Doge]] and a 35% chance to freeze cats.
*[[Tarsiriel]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/Sage variant of [[LeMurr]] that behaves much like [[Loris]], but slows cats as opposed to cursing them. Deals even less damage than Loris, with 320 standing range rather than 449.

